    <node id="scope_description:create_a_library_of_he_characterizations_for_new:30899b78a0">
      <data key="d4">Create a library of HE characterizations for new and existing formulations . Characterization of HE microstructures and documentation are FY26 growth areas. The Energetic Binders task will explore the characterization of the set of polymers already prepared on a small scale. Promising binders will be scale-up and formulated to determine binder properties and compatibilities. Enables AI/ML. Cannot apply AI/ML without supporting data in correct formats.</data>
      <data key="d5">scope_description</data>
      <data key="d6">programming_data.csv</data>
    </node>
