    <node id="scope_description:use_ml_to_develop_synthesis_pathways_to_novel_hi:ca4f21f7ce">
      <data key="d4">Use ML to develop synthesis pathways to novel high-performance materials. Synthesize candidate materials in each of the programmatic driver areas. The materials developed will then be characterized chemically, characterized with respect to small scale sensitivity and performance properties. Failure to support will result in the complex to continue to be restricted to 2 high explosives, an HMX based and a TATB based with all the issues and limitations we have been dealing with. Additional explosives, with different capabilities will enable systems design options not currently possible</data>
      <data key="d5">scope_description</data>
      <data key="d6">programming_data.csv</data>
    </node>
    <node id="program_request:use_ml_to_develop_synthesis_pathways:0d118f3bc7">
