      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description references applying AI to “accelerating mission problems, increasing enterprise efficiency, or increasing scientific/engineering insight,” which is generic and could map to any of the three challenges. There is no explicit mention of experiments, facilities, or safety-basis processes that would clearly indicate the other two options. Given the emphasis on enterprise efficiency and acceleration, the closest fit is the acquisition-focused challenge, but the evidence is weak and non-specific, so confidence is low. SME correction: Corrected</data>
