      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on using machine learning to develop synthesis pathways to novel high-performance materials, synthesizing and characterizing candidate materials, and enabling new explosives with different capabilities. This directly aligns with the materials-centric Genesis challenge that aims to accelerate materials discovery, production, and qualification for strategic deterrence. The emphasis on new materials, performance properties, and expanding options for systems design clearly maps to the materials discovery and qualification lifecycle, not to design/production integration or nonproliferation monitoring.</data>
      <data key="d18">DECREMENT</data>
      <data key="d19">-3453300.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
