      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on AI/ML tools to automatically index, catalog, extract metadata, and enable search across an increased number of digital repositories. This aligns directly with the challenge to digitize, structure, and make accessible historic nuclear data and records via AI-driven digitization and information extraction pipelines, rather than materials development or production-process optimization.</data>
