      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on developing experimental capabilities and support for target metrology in Fusion Yield Platforms within Inertial Confinement Fusion Facility Operations. This directly aligns with increasing experimental capacity and optimizing use of limited high-consequence experimental facilities, rather than integrating design/production workflows or primarily streamlining regulatory processes.</data>
