      <data key="d14">26</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope centers on AI for ignition applications, double-shell experiment analysis, simulations, and pulse-shaping machine learning for stockpile-related inertial confinement fusion. This is operational, physics-informed AI for real-time or near-real-time analysis and decision support in a mission-critical nuclear context, aligning best with the challenge focused on deploying multimodal, continuously learning AI fusion systems for nuclear threat assessment and response. It does not primarily concern materials lifecycle workflows or digitization of historical archives, so the materials and historic-data challenges are less consistent with the described work. SME correction: Corrected</data>
