      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description “Constraining Mix using radiochemistry on NIF” and the WBS/STAT context (ICF Diagnostics &amp; Instrumentation under Inertial Confinement Fusion and Stockpile Research, Technology, and Engineering) indicate work focused on experimental diagnostics and measurements at the National Ignition Facility. This aligns most directly with the challenge centered on increasing experimental capacity at nuclear research facilities, which emphasizes optimizing experiments, diagnostics, and facility throughput for stockpile stewardship. The other challenges focus on historical data digitization or nuclear threat response, which are less consistent with NIF radiochemistry and diagnostics work.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">2000000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
