      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope emphasizes NA-11’s UFR titled “Developing Artificial Intelligence Tools for Nuclear Deterrence,” which most directly aligns with the Genesis Mission challenge focused on integrating AI into nuclear weapons design and production for deterrence. While the text is high-level and references both platform and Mission S&amp;T Challenges, the explicit nuclear deterrence framing and NA-11 stockpile/ICF context point more strongly to the design-and-production-focused nuclear deterrence challenge than to business/management processes or acquisition optimization.</data>
      <data key="d18">UFR</data>
      <data key="d19">5000000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
