      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on developing a large language model to identify replacement HE binder candidates and on developing high‑performance, multimetal alloys optimized for strength and stability with new additive manufacturing methods that meet future system requirements. This is directly about discovering and developing new materials and qualifying them for future systems, aligned with advanced manufacturing. That maps most closely to the materials-focused challenge on accelerating materials discovery, production, and qualification, rather than enterprise-wide design/production integration or experimental facility throughput.</data>
