      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is extremely terse (“Critical Executable CE UFR: Programmatic AI”) and provides almost no direct detail. Supporting context indicates this is a Multi-Weapon Systems (formerly MTP) effort under Stockpile Management / Stockpile Operations, with a focus on digital transformation and AI within the AI Genesis Mission. Among the candidate challenges, the one most closely aligned with multi-weapon, enterprise-level AI for deterrence and integrating across design/production and operations is “Integrating Design and Production Operations for Nuclear Deterrence.” However, because the description lacks explicit references to DA/PA integration, experimental facilities, or regulatory streamlining, the mapping is uncertain, so confidence is low.</data>
