      <data key="d17">The scope description explicitly focuses on accelerating nuclear forensics attribution timelines for nuclear or radiological incidents and leveraging AI for post-event processing. This directly aligns with the attribution and nuclear forensics emphasis of the “Strengthening Deterrence Through Attribution of Nuclear and Radiological Signatures” challenge, rather than enterprise acquisition or broader threat assessment/preparedness. Supporting evidence includes the STAT lines for Forensics R&amp;D and the program request title “AI ACCELERATION FOR NUCLEAR FORENSICS TIMELINES.”</data>
