      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is generic (“AI PROGRAM WORK”), so supporting fields drive the mapping. The STAT hierarchy is Defense Nuclear Nonproliferation R&amp;D with a focus on Proliferation Detection, directly aligning with AI-enabled monitoring and detection of nuclear proliferation activities. Among the candidate challenges, “Safeguarding Nuclear Materials from Proliferation Threats” explicitly targets nonproliferation and detection of proliferation-relevant anomalies, matching the Proliferation Detection WBS/STAT context, whereas the other options focus on AI-induced proliferation risk or materials discovery for deterrence rather than nonproliferation R&amp;D.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">165000000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA20</data>
