      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on supporting and implementing activities under an Executive Order and expanding IAEA safeguards at U.S. nuclear facilities, which is directly tied to international safeguards, verification, and nonproliferation. The WBS and STAT hierarchy (Nonproliferation and Arms Control; Civil Nuclear Cooperation &amp; Engagement) and NA-20 context further align with global nonproliferation monitoring and safeguarding nuclear materials, matching the Safeguarding Nuclear Materials from Proliferation Threats challenge more closely than experimental capacity or acquisition-focused challenges.</data>
