      <data key="d14">43</data>
      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on using AI to enhance capabilities within the Security &amp; Safeguards (S&amp;S) program, addressing gaps and efficiencies, and ensuring efforts are integrated and complementary with the overall NNSA Genesis mission. This aligns with the business and management–oriented challenge that emphasizes integrating AI into workflows, improving efficiency, and unifying efforts across organizations, rather than with design/production of nuclear deterrence systems or nonproliferation monitoring. The WBS (Security Program Operations &amp; Planning) and STAT categories further support a business/operations improvement context. SME correction: Corrected</data>
