      <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes advancing AI tools for rapid and effective response to nuclear and radiological events, detailed analysis of vast and varied data, and overall nuclear risk mitigation and response. These align directly with the challenge focused on shrinking detection-to-response times via multimodal AI fusion for real-time situational awareness and crisis decision support. While the description also mentions improving nuclear forensics (which relates to attribution), the primary thrust is broader emergency response and risk mitigation, matching the Accelerating Nuclear Threat Assessment, Preparedness, and Response challenge most closely.</data>
