      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope describes replacing overloaded telecommunications towers to meet current and future communication demands, categorized under Infrastructure and Operations and Maintenance and Repair of Facilities. This most directly supports improving facility infrastructure and capacity, which aligns best—though still indirectly—with increasing experimental capacity at nuclear research facilities. The other challenges focus more on production/regulatory streamlining or materials discovery rather than core facility communications infrastructure. However, the linkage to any specific Genesis challenge is weak, so confidence is low.</data>
