      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope describes constructing a new central computing facility to ensure reliable classified and unclassified computing availability, providing space for network and data servers/hubs and personnel. This is a general-purpose computing and data infrastructure project rather than a materials workflow or design/production integration effort. Among the options, it most plausibly supports the data-centric, archival, and AI-accessible infrastructure envisioned in “Harnessing America’s Historic Nuclear Data and Research,” which depends on secure, scalable computing and data environments. However, the description is high-level and not explicitly tied to digitization or historical data, so confidence is low. SME correction: Corrected</data>
