      <data key="d17">The scope description indicates funding for a “New Central Computing Facility, Y-12 OPCs,” which most directly relates to building or upgrading computing and facility infrastructure. Among the options, this aligns best with “Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities,” since enhanced central computing at a nuclear site would support higher experimental throughput and facility operations. There is no explicit link to materials workflows or acquisition modernization, so the mapping is inferred from the facility/computing context, resulting in low confidence.</data>
