      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description only notes “AI Data Center activities associated with SWEIS/NEPA,” tied to environmental and safety operations. There is no clear indication of business-process optimization or design/production integration, making the business and deterrence challenges a weaker fit. The most plausible link is to the historic data and research challenge, since AI data center activities for NEPA/SWEIS could support digitization, management, and AI-ready use of environmental and nuclear-related records, but the evidence is sparse and indirect, so confidence is low. SME correction: Corrected</data>
