      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on maintaining an NNSA decision and analytics platform and developing new data analysis, operational, and AI tools. This aligns most closely with the challenge centered on real-time nuclear threat assessment and response, which emphasizes multimodal data fusion, decision support, and operational analytics for NEST and emergency response. While safety and regulatory efficiency are relevant, the emphasis on decision platforms and analytics for operational use better matches the threat assessment and response challenge than the data-digitization or regulatory-streamlining challenges. SME correction: Corrected</data>
