      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on maintaining an NNSA decision and analytics platform and developing new data analysis, operational, and AI tools for safety analytics, forecasting, evaluation, and reporting (SAFER). This aligns most closely with the challenge centered on real-time nuclear threat assessment and response, which emphasizes multimodal data fusion, decision support, and risk metrics for emergency and safety operations. While there is some overlap with the production/safety-streamlining challenge, the emphasis on analytics, forecasting, and decision platforms for safety and environmental operations better matches the threat assessment and response context. SME correction: Corrected</data>
