      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on “AI-enabled cybersecurity tools that support the enterprise,” and the STAT/WBS context is Enterprise Operations under Information Technology &amp; Cybersecurity. This aligns best with improving and securing enterprise-wide business/management platforms and workflows rather than directly targeting acquisition processes or production/safety in nuclear facilities. Among the options, the business and management challenge is the closest fit to enterprise IT and cybersecurity enablement for national security missions, though the evidence is somewhat general, so confidence is medium. SME correction: Corrected</data>
