      <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on funding annual licenses and tokens for AI capabilities, without specific reference to acquisition workflows or historic nuclear data. The broader context lists the program interest area as “AI GENESIS PLATFORM,” suggesting enterprise AI tooling to support general business and management functions rather than a targeted acquisition system (AMIS) or digitization of historic nuclear records. This aligns best with the challenge centered on creating an integrated AI ecosystem and unified business/management platform to accelerate national security mission support processes.</data>
