      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is broad—funding all labor and equipment for Artificial Intelligence investments—and the WBS name is simply “Artificial Intelligence - Program Work,” with STAT codes under Information Technology. The only additional clue is the program interest area “AI GENESIS PLATFORM,” which most closely aligns with the business and management–focused Genesis platform described in the “Accelerating Business and Management Processes for National Security Missions” challenge (unified business and management platform with integrated AI tools). There is no indication of historic nuclear data digitization or acquisition-specific tooling, so the business and management processes challenge is the best fit, though the generic wording limits confidence to medium.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">15148200.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NAIM</data>
