      <data key="d17">The scope emphasizes enterprise connectivity, secure AI models and tools, data governance, cybersecurity, and AI workforce readiness as foundational capabilities for current operations and future Genesis AI initiatives. Among the challenges, this most closely aligns with the acquisition-focused mission, which explicitly calls for an AI platform integrated with enterprise acquisition systems, strong data governance, secure infrastructure, and auditable AI tools to improve operational efficiency across the nuclear enterprise. The funding appears to underwrite broad AI platform and infrastructure capabilities that would directly enable the Accelerating Nuclear Enterprise Acquisition challenge and related acquisition operations, even though the description is general rather than acquisition-specific, hence medium confidence. SME correction: Corrected</data>
