      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes advancing AI tools for rapid and effective response to nuclear and radiological events, detailed analysis of vast and varied data, and nuclear risk mitigation and response. This aligns directly with the first challenge’s focus on shrinking detection-to-response times, multimodal AI fusion for real-time situational awareness, and crisis-time decision support. While the scope also mentions improving nuclear forensics (which relates to attribution), the primary thrust is broader threat assessment and response, matching the Accelerating Nuclear Threat Assessment, Preparedness, and Response challenge most closely.</data>
      <data key="d18">UFR</data>
      <data key="d19">5000000.0</data>
